    <h1>About Scholars Planet</h1>
    <p>Closing the information gap between students and the opportunities meant for them.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="page">
  <div class="wrap content">
    <p>Scholars Planet is a scholarship and opportunity information platform started to close one simple but costly gap: good opportunities exist, but the students who need them most often hear about them too late, or never at all.</p>

    <h2>Our story</h2>
    <p>Scholars Planet began with Samuel, a student who missed the interview for a $1,000 scholarship because the notification email arrived weeks late — and he had no reliable place to have found it sooner. That single missed opportunity became the reason Scholars Planet exists: so that timing and access to information are never the reason a student misses their chance.</p>
    <p>What started as a WhatsApp channel has grown to reach over 3,400 students, with more than 2,700 going on to benefit from scholarships, and over 3,000 benefiting from free digital learning and fellowship programmes.</p>

    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>To close the information gap in education access by curating and delivering verified scholarships, grants, fellowships and skills opportunities to students who might otherwise never hear about them in time.</p>

    <h2>Our vision</h2>
    <p>A future where no student's education or career is limited by lack of access to information — where opportunity is determined by ability and effort, not by who happened to hear about it first.</p>

    <h2>Aligned with the UN Sustainable Development Goals</h2>
    <p>Scholars Planet's work is grounded in three of the UN Sustainable Development Goals:</p>
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-card">
        <h3>SDG 4 — Quality Education</h3>
        <p>We work to ensure inclusive and equitable access to education by removing the information barrier that keeps eligible students from applying to scholarships, grants and training programmes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-card">
        <h3>SDG 10 — Reduced Inequalities</h3>
        <p>By reaching students regardless of location, school, or existing network, we work to reduce the inequality in who gets to hear about — and benefit from — educational opportunity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-card">
        <h3>SDG 8 — Decent Work and Economic Growth</h3>
        <p>Through free digital skills programmes shared on the platform, we help students build capabilities that open pathways to decent work and sustainable income.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

